  charType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2250251fc32ffca4abeb9fd108bfc3de, type: 2}
  lineTexts:
  - Who are you! You are a weird looking boar!
  - 'Oh! I know! You are one of those poor pink hairless pigs those humans keep behind
    that fence! '
  - I'm quite rushed, but I'm curious about how you got here, so please tell me your
    story!
  - ...
  - ...
  - You know what? We usually don't like outsiders, but if you pass our herd test,
    you can join us. Meet me at the swamp in the south-west.
